# last level. E minor, faster, a bit more pressure
tempo 116
rows 4

inst arp   square   vol 0.07 duty 0.125 attack 0.002 decay 0.12 sustain 0.0
inst lead  square   vol 0.10 duty 0.4 attack 0.01 decay 0.3 sustain 0.5 release 0.1 vibrato 0.01
inst bass  triangle vol 0.32 attack 0.004 decay 0.2 sustain 0.5 release 0.04
inst kit   drum     vol 0.24

pattern em
arp   E4 G4 B4 G4 | E4 G4 B4 G4 | E4 G4 B4 E5 | B4 G4 E4 G4
bass  E2 .  E2 .  | .  E2 .  .  | E2 .  E2 .  | .  D2 .  .
kit   k  .  h  k  | s  .  h  .  | k  .  h  k  | s  .  h  h

pattern em_lead
arp   E4 G4 B4 G4 | E4 G4 B4 G4 | E4 G4 B4 E5 | B4 G4 E4 G4
lead  E5 .  .  .  | D5 .  B4 .  | G4 .  A4 .  | B4 .  .  -
bass  E2 .  E2 .  | .  E2 .  .  | E2 .  E2 .  | .  D2 .  .
kit   k  .  h  k  | s  .  h  .  | k  .  h  k  | s  .  h  h

pattern c
arp   C4 E4 G4 E4 | C4 E4 G4 E4 | C4 E4 G4 C5 | G4 E4 C4 E4
lead  E5 .  .  .  | G5 .  E5 .  | D5 .  C5 .  | B4 .  .  -
bass  C2 .  C2 .  | .  C2 .  .  | C2 .  C2 .  | .  B1 .  .
kit   k  .  h  k  | s  .  h  .  | k  .  h  k  | s  .  h  h

pattern d
arp   D4 F#4 A4 F#4 | D4 F#4 A4 F#4 | D4 F#4 A4 D5 | A4 F#4 D4 F#4
lead  F#5 . .  .  | E5 .  D5 .  | A4 .  .  .  | F#4 . .  -
bass  D2 .  D2 .  | .  D2 .  .  | D2 .  D2 .  | .  A1 .  .
kit   k  .  h  k  | s  .  h  .  | k  .  h  k  | s  .  h  h

pattern b
arp   B3 D#4 F#4 D#4 | B3 D#4 F#4 D#4 | B3 D#4 F#4 B4 | F#4 D#4 B3 D#4
lead  B4 .  .  .  | .  .  .  .  | D#5 . .  .  | F#5 . .  -
bass  B1 .  B1 .  | .  B1 .  .  | B1 .  B1 .  | .  B1 .  .
kit   k  .  h  k  | s  .  h  .  | k  k  s  k  | s  s  s  c

order em em em_lead c d b em_lead c d b
